y of shots; a browser test that screenshots every shot of an area for review (`tests/browser/shots.test.mjs`) | the follow shot everywhere, plus hand shots at junctions and set pieces |"," | Invisible enemies feel unfair | They are the core challenge | Four tells (laugh, ripple, footprints, breath), a short scan cooldown, bot damage metrics per area, difficulty settings | longer reveal and slower enemies through TUNING defaults |"]}]},{"filePath":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174758__x42640e/agent.out","hunks":[{"oldStart":2159,"oldLines":3,"newStart":2159,"newLines":4,"lines":[" {\"type\":\"system\",\"subtype\":\"thinking_tokens\",\"estimated_tokens\":450,\"estimated_tokens_delta\":150,\"session_id\":\"07d72fa0-3e0a-4abc-a856-6a3bd495de67\",\"uuid\":\"4bd22a0a-23c6-4c7e-bf9c-f76b466adeac\"}"," {\"type\":\"system\",\"subtype\":\"thinking_tokens\",\"estimated_tokens\":550,\"estimated_tokens_delta\":100,\"session_id\":\"07d72fa0-3e0a-4abc-a856-6a3bd495de67\",\"uuid\":\"b95994ed-0c75-4aee-ad8f-3365205fe279\"}"," {\"type\":\"system\",\"subtype\":\"thinking_tokens\",\"estimated_tokens\":650,\"estimated_tokens_delta\":100,\"session_id\":\"07d72fa0-3e0a-4abc-a856-6a3bd495de67\",\"uuid\":\"0384a828-225b-424f-91f7-b948bd1e0894\"}","+{\"type\":\"system\",\"subtype\":\"thinking_tokens\",\"estimated_tokens\":750,\"estimated_tokens_delta\":100,\"session_id\":\"07d72fa0-3e0a-4abc-a856-6a3bd495de67\",\"uuid\":\"f5477170-3793-47cf-a95a-cae2140955cc\"}"]}]},{"filePath":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174807__x5c5240/agent.out","hunks":[{"oldStart":2161,"oldLines":3,"newStart":2161,"newLines":4,"lines":[" {\"type\":\"system\",\"subtype\":\"thinking_tokens\",\"estimated_tokens\":4550,\"estimated_tokens_delta\":100,\"session_id\":\"3c819b0f-1b18-471b-b765-9dcf56869a17\",\"uuid\":\"89b39ef3-80eb-4386-811c-bd1b38be8aad\"}"," {\"type\":\"system\",\"subtype\":\"thinking_tokens\",\"estimated_tokens\":4700,\"estimated_to