zPnYjAcgTjzWWb1T\",\"type\":\"message\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"The enemy frame works: soldiers, a jeep, a civilian, a crate, sandbags, and closing rings on three of the targets. The visual checks are done, so I'll write the real About/Credits content next, with the Source Information and the three feedback sections.\"}],\"container\":null,\"stop_reason\":null,\"stop_sequence\":null,\"stop_details\":null,\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":2,\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":885,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":260046,\"cache_creation\":{\"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens\":0,\"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens\":885},\"output_tokens\":3,\"service_tier\":\"standard\",\"inference_geo\":\"global\",\"speed\":\"standard\"},\"input_transformations\":[],\"diagnostics\":null,\"context_management\":null},\"parent_tool_use_id\":null,\"session_id\":\"972ca841-0540-4c71-85fe-204eae6bea61\",\"uuid\":\"235aaf23-4389-4675-b8e6-402e7f686045\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-04T02:08:50.313Z\",\"request_id\":\"req_011Cgh5Az6vWybUN1HaEN9sw\"}","+{\"type\":\"assistant\",\"message\":{\"model\":\"claude-haiku-5-5\",\"id\":\"msg_011Cgh5AzPnYjAcgTjzWWb1T\",\"type\":\"message\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"id\":\"toolu_01URsBje8UPxCfnqbZXHXojk\",\"name\":\"Write\",\"input\":{\"file_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-haiku-5-5-medium.build__20261103-185013__xe162c9/work/OperationWolfpack-OperationWolf-claude-haiku-5-5-medium-20261103-185013/src/03-credits.js\",\"content\":\"// The About and Credits screen's lines: the game's own credits, then the four sections the brief asks for (the same\\n// text is in the chat reply). Lines that start with # are headings. \\\"unknown\\\" marks what could not be confirmed.\\n(() => {\\n'use strict';\\nconst WP = globalThis.WP;\\n\\nWP.CREDITS = [\\n  ...WP.ABOUT,\\n  '',\\n  '#SOURCE INFORMATION',\\n  'DATE: 2026-11-03 18:50:13',\\n  'SOURCE: OPERATION WOLF (TAITO, 1987)',\\n  'PLAN: PLAN.MD (WRITTEN FOR THE GAME, BUILT FROM IT)',\\n  'GENRE: FIRST-PERSON LIGHT-GUN RAIL SHOOTER (SHOOTER)',\\n  'PERSPECTIVE: FIRST PERSON ON A SCRIPTED RAIL, SIDEWAYS AND IN DEPTH',\\n  'TECH: MY-3D2DGE ENGINE 0.85.2 (HANDOFF), JAVASCRIPT, 480X270 PIXEL CANVAS',\\n  'ART DIRECTION: PIXEL ART MADE IN CODE, DEPTH-SCALED, DUSK AND DAWN PALETTES',\\n  'ANIMATION: PROCEDURAL (RISE AND DROP FROM COVER, CLOSING RINGS, RECOIL)',\\n  'AUDIO: ENGINE CHIP SYNTH, SFX AND VOICE BLIPS IN CODE; ENGINE SONGS',\\n  'ONLINE: NONE (AI HUB MULTIPLAYER NOT BUILT)',\\n  'TESTING: BOT PLAYTHROUGHS, UNIT CHECKS, SCREENSHOTS IN CHROMIUM',\\n  'RESEARCH: NONE OF MY OWN; THE PLAN\\\\'S SUMMARY OF THE SOURCE',\\n  'ENVIRONMENT: CLAUDE CODE CLI (HEADLESS); LINUX (WSL2); CHROMIUM',\\n  'MODEL: ANTHROPIC, CLAUDE-HAIKU-5-5, REASONING EFFORT MEDIUM',\\n  'USAGE: UNKNOWN',\\n  '',\\n  '#TESTING FEEDBACK',\\n  'ISSUES CAUGHT: ABOUT EIGHT. TWO WERE BREAKING IN A BROWSER: THE CANVAS',\\n  'DREW AT 300X150 (THE PAGE CSS WAS MISSING), AND THE FIRST FRAME RAN',\\n  'BEFORE THE BOT FILE LOADED (A CRASH ON A DEEP LINK INTO ATTRACT).',\\n  'OTHERS: THE OP2 QUOTA SHORT (HOSTAGE GUARDS NOT COUNTED), A RETURN',\\n  'FROM DEV THAT WOULD RESTART THE BATTLE, HUD AND DEV LAYOUT OVERLAP.',\\n  'MOST HELPFUL: THE BOT PLAYS EACH OPERATION TO ITS BOSS HEADLESS, AND',\\n  'THE SCREENSHOTS, WHICH SHOWED THE CANVAS AND LAYOUT PROBLEMS.',\\n  'LEAST HELPFUL: THE STUB-BUFFER DRAW PASS. IT ONLY SHOWS NO EXCEPTION.',\\n  '',\\n  '#ENGINE FEEDBACK',\\n  'MOST LIKED: E.GAME GIVES SCENES, PAUSE, SETTINGS, INPUT PRESETS, AUDIO',\\n  'AND A HEADLESS LOOP FOR TESTS. E.ARCADE GIVES THE TABLE AND INITIALS.',\\n  'STUCK OR GUESSED: THE CANVAS SIZE (THE TEMPLATE CSS, COPIED), THE',\\n  'FIRST FRAME RUNNING BEFORE LATER FILES LOAD, AND THE HASH DEEP LINKS.',\\n  'MOST BUILT BY HAND: THE BATTLE RULES, THE RAIL AND BEAT GENERATOR,',\\n  'THE TELEGRAPH RINGS, THE DEPTH PAINTER, THE HUD, AND THE BOT.',\\n  'HARDEST: THE API CARD IS LONG AND THE PIXEL FUNCTIONS SNAP TO WHOLE',\\n  'PIXELS, SO SCALED SPRITES NEED A RUN-LENGTH PAINTER OF MY OWN.',\\n  'CHANGED IN THE ENGINE: NONE.',\\n  'ONE CHANGE I WOULD MAKE: A CLEAR RULE FOR CANVAS SIZE WITH A FIXED RES.',\\n  '',\\n  '#PROMPT FEEDBACK',\\n  'MOST LIKED: THE PLAN\\\\'S EXACT NAMES, FILES, TESTS AND DONE CRITERIA.',\\n  'CONFUSING: THE TASK AND THE PLAN ASK FOR FAR MORE THAN ONE RUN FITS',\\n  '(SIX OPERATIONS, AI HUB, LOCAL CO-OP, RIGS, MODE 7), AND THE PLAN',\\n  'NAMES A DIFFERENT MODEL AND EFFORT FROM THE TASK. THE TASK WON.',\\n  'HARDEST: MULTIPLAYER INTEGRATION, WHICH NEEDS THE HUB HARNESS.',\\n  'WOULD CHANGE: SPLIT IT INTO MILESTONES, EACH WITH ITS OWN DONE LINE.',\\n];\\n})();\\n\"},\"caller\":{\"type\":\"direct\"}}],\"container\":null,\"stop_reason\":null,\"stop_sequence\":null,\"stop_details\":null,\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":2,\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":885,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":260046,\"cache_creation\":{\"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens\":0,\"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens\":885},\"output_tokens\":3,\"service_tier\":\"standard\",\"inference_geo\":\"global\",\"speed\":\"standard\"},\"input_transformations\":[],\"diagnostics\":null,\"context_management\":null},\"parent_tool_use_id\":null,\"session_id\":\"972ca841-0540-4c71-85fe-204eae6bea61\",\"uuid\":\"42ed77b3-baf2-4283-a359-894a5ecef7e4\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-04T02:08:58.104Z\",\"request_id\":\"req_011Cgh5Az6vWybUN1HaEN9sw\",\"wire_tool_inputs\":{\"toolu_01URsBje8UPxCfnqbZXHXojk\":{\"file_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-haiku-5-5-medium.build__20261103-185013__xe162c9/work/OperationWolfpack-OperationWolf-claude-haiku-5-5-medium-20261103-185013/src/03-credits.js\",\"content\":\"// The About and Credits screen's lines: the game's own credits, then the four sections the brief asks for (the same\\n// text is in the chat reply). Lines that start with # are headings. \\\"unknown\\\" marks what could not be confirmed.\\n(() => {\\n'use strict';\\nconst WP = globalThis.WP;\\n\\nWP.CREDITS = [\\n  ...WP.ABOUT,\\n  '',\\n  '#SOURCE INFORMATION',\\n  'DATE: 2026-11-03 18:50:13',\\n  'SOURCE: OPERATION WOLF (TAITO, 1987)',\\n  'PLAN: PLAN.MD (WRITTEN FOR THE GAME, BUILT FROM IT)',\\n  'GENRE: FIRST-PERSON LIGHT-GUN RAIL SHOOTER (SHOOTER)',\\n  'PERSPECTIVE: FIRST PERSON ON A SCRIPTED RAIL, SIDEWAYS AND IN DEPTH',\\n  'TECH: MY-3D2DGE ENGINE 0.85.2 (HANDOFF), JAVASCRIPT, 480X270 PIXEL CANVAS',\\n  'ART DIRECTION: PIXEL ART MADE IN CODE, DEPTH-SCALED, DUSK AND DAWN PALETTES',\\n  'ANIMATION: PROCEDURAL (RISE AND DROP FROM COVER, CLOSING RINGS, RECOIL)',\\n  'AUDIO: ENGINE CHIP SYNTH, SFX AND VOICE BLIPS IN CODE; ENGINE SONGS',\\n  'ONLINE: NONE (AI HUB MULTIPLAYER NOT BUILT)',\\n  'TESTING: BOT PLAYTHROUGHS, UNIT CHECKS, SCREENSHOTS IN CHROMIUM',\\n  'RESEARCH: NONE OF MY OWN; THE PLAN\\\\'S SUMMARY OF THE SOURCE',\\n  'ENVIRONMENT: CLAUDE CODE CLI (HEADLESS); LINUX (WSL2); CHROMIUM',\\n  'MODEL: ANTHROPIC, CLAUDE-HAIKU-5-5, REASONING EFFORT MEDIUM',\\n  'USAGE: UNKNOWN',\\n  '',\\n  '#TESTING FEEDBACK',\\n  'ISSUES CAUGHT: ABOUT EIGHT. TWO WERE BREAKING IN A BROWSER: THE CANVAS',\\n  'DREW AT 300X150 (THE PAGE CSS WAS MISSING), AND THE FIRST FRAME RAN',\\n  'BEFORE THE BOT FILE LOADED (A CRASH ON A DEEP LINK INTO ATTRACT).',\\n  'OTHERS: THE OP2 QUOTA SHORT (HOSTAGE GUARDS NOT COUNTED), A RETURN',\\n  'FROM DEV THAT WOULD RESTART THE BATTLE, HUD AND DEV LAYOUT OVERLAP.',\\n  'MOST HELPFUL: THE BOT PLAYS EACH OPERATION TO ITS BOSS HEADLESS, AND',\\n  'THE SCREENSHOTS, WHICH SHOWED THE CANVAS AND LAYOUT PROBLEMS.',\\n  'LEAST HELPFUL: THE STUB-BUFFER DRAW PASS. IT ONLY SHOWS NO EXCEPTION.',\\n  '',\\n  '#ENGINE FEEDBACK',\\n  'MOST LIKED: E.GAME GIVES SCENES, PAUSE, SETTINGS, INPUT PRESETS, AUDIO',\\n  'AND A HEADLESS LOOP FOR TESTS. E.ARCADE GIVES THE TABLE AND INITIALS.',\\n  'STUCK OR GUESSED: THE CANVAS SIZE (THE TEMPLATE CSS, COPIED), THE',\\n  'FIRST FRAME RUNNING BEFORE LATER FILES LOAD, AND THE HASH DEEP LINKS.',\\n  'MOST BUILT BY HAND: THE BATTLE RULES, THE RAIL AND BEAT GENERATOR,',\\n  'THE TELEGRAPH RINGS, THE DEPTH PAINTER, THE HUD, AND THE BOT.',\\n  'HARDEST: THE API CARD IS LONG AND THE PIXEL FUNCTIONS SNAP TO WHOLE',\\n  'PIXELS, SO SCALED SPRITES NEED A RUN-LENGTH PAINTER OF MY OWN.',\\n  'CHANGED IN THE ENGINE: NONE.',\\n  'ONE CHANGE I WOULD MAKE: A CLEAR RULE FOR CANVAS SIZE WITH A FIXED RES.',\\n  '',\\n  '#PROMPT FEEDBACK',\\n  'MOST LIKED: THE PLAN\\\\'S EXACT NAMES, FILES, TESTS AND DONE CRITERIA.',\\n  'CONFUSING: THE TASK AND THE PLAN ASK FOR FAR MORE THAN ONE RUN FITS',\\n  '(SIX OPERATIONS, AI HUB, LOCAL CO-OP, RIGS, MODE 7), AND THE PLAN',\\n  'NAMES A DIFFERENT MODEL AND EFFORT FROM THE TASK. THE TASK WON.',\\n  'HARDEST: MULTIPLAYER INTEGRATION, WHICH NEEDS THE HUB HARNESS.',\\n  'WOULD CHANGE: SPLIT IT INTO MILESTONES, EACH WITH ITS OWN DONE LINE.',\\n];\\n})();\\n\"}}}","+{\"type\":\"user\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"tool_use_id\":\"toolu_01URsBje8UPxCfnqbZXHXojk\",\"type\":\"tool_result\",\"content\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-haiku-5-5-medium.build__20261103-185013__xe162c9/work/OperationWolfpack-OperationWolf-claude-haiku-5-5-medium-20261103-185013/src/03-credits.js has been updated successfully. (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)\"}]},\"parent_tool_use_id\":null,\"session_id\":\"972ca841-0540-4c71-85fe-204eae6bea61\",\"uuid\":\"794e3a9f-3034-4b3f-8cd5-091e12d1edc6\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-04T02:08:58.132Z\",\"tool_use_result\":{\"type\":\"update\",\"filePath\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-haiku-5-5-medium.build__20261103-185013__xe162c9/work/OperationWolfpack-OperationWolf-claude-haiku-5-5-medium-20261103-185013/src/03-credits.js\",\"content\":\"// The About and Credits screen's lines: the game's own credits, then the four sections the brief asks for (the same\\n// text is in the chat reply). Lines that start with # are headings. \\\"unknown\\\" marks what could not be confirmed.\\n(() => {\\n'use strict';\\nconst WP = globalThis.WP;\\n\\nWP.CREDITS = [\\n  ...WP.ABOUT,\\n  '',\\n  '#SOURCE INFORMATION',\\n  'DATE: 2026-11-03 18:50:13',\\n  'SOURCE: OPERATION WOLF (TAITO, 1987)',\\n  'PLAN: PLAN.MD (WRITTEN FOR THE GAME, BUILT FROM IT)',\\n  'GENRE: FIRST-PERSON LIGHT-GUN RAIL SHOOTER (SHOOTER)',\\n  'PERSPECTIVE: FIRST PERSON ON A SCRIPTED RAIL, SIDEWAYS AND IN DEPTH',\\n  'TECH: MY-3D2DGE ENGINE 0.85.2 (HANDOFF), JAVASCRIPT, 480X270 PIXEL CANVAS',\\n  'ART DIRECTION: PIXEL ART MADE IN CODE, DEPTH-SCALED, DUSK AND DAWN PALETTES',\\n  'ANIMATION: PROCEDURAL (RISE AND DROP FROM COVER, CLOSING RINGS, RECOIL)',\\n  'AUDIO: ENGINE CHIP SYNTH, SFX AND VOICE BLIPS IN CODE; ENGINE SONGS',\\n  'ONLINE: NONE (AI HUB MULTIPLAYER NOT BUILT)',\\n  'TESTING: BOT PLAYTHROUGHS, UNIT CHECKS, SCREENSHOTS IN CHROMIUM',\\n  'RESEARCH: NONE OF MY OWN; THE PLAN\\\\'S SUMMARY OF THE SOURCE',\\n  'ENVIRONMENT: CLAUDE CODE CLI (HEADLESS); LINUX (WSL2); CHROMIUM',\\n  'MODEL: ANTHROPIC, CLAUDE-HAIKU-5-5, REASONING EFFORT MEDIUM',\\n  'USAGE: UNKNOWN',\\n  '',\\n  '#TESTING FEEDBACK',\\n  'ISSUES CAUGHT: ABOUT EIGHT. TWO WERE BREAKING IN A BROWSER: THE CANVAS',\\n  'DREW AT 300X150 (THE PAGE CSS WAS MISSING), AND THE FIRST FRAME RAN',\\n  'BEFORE THE BOT FILE LOADED (A CRASH ON A DEEP LINK INTO ATTRACT).',\\n  'OTHERS: THE OP2 QUOTA SHORT (HOSTAGE GUARDS NOT COUNTED), A RETURN',\\n  'FROM DEV THAT WOULD RESTART THE BATTLE, HUD AND DEV LAYOUT OVERLAP.',\\n  'MOST HELPFUL: THE BOT PLAYS EACH OPERATION TO ITS BOSS HEADLESS, AND',\\n  'THE SCREENSHOTS, WHICH SHOWED THE CANVAS AND LAYOUT PROBLEMS.',\\n  'LEAST HELPFUL: THE STUB-BUFFER DRAW PASS. IT ONLY SHOWS NO EXCEPTION.',\\n  '',\\n  '#ENGINE FEEDBACK',\\n  'MOST LIKED: E.GAME GIVES SCENES, PAUSE, SETTINGS, INPUT PRESETS, AUDIO',\\n  'AND A HEADLESS LOOP FOR TESTS. E.ARCADE GIVES THE TABLE AND INITIALS.',\\n  'STUCK OR GUESSED: THE CANVAS SIZE (THE TEMPLATE CSS, COPIED), THE',\\n  'FIRST FRAME RUNNING BEFORE LATER FILES LOAD, AND THE HASH DEEP LINKS.',\\n  'MOST BUILT BY HAND: THE BATTLE RULES, THE RAIL AND BEAT GENERATOR,',\\n  'THE TELEGRAPH RINGS, THE DEPTH PAINTER, THE HUD, AND THE BOT.',\\n  'HARDEST: THE API CARD IS LONG AND THE PIXEL FUNCTIONS SNAP TO WHOLE',\\n  'PIXELS, SO SCALED SPRITES NEED A RUN-LENGTH PAINTER OF MY OWN.',\\n  'CHANGED IN THE ENGINE: NONE.',\\n  'ONE CHANGE I WOULD MAKE: A CLEAR RULE FOR CANVAS SIZE WITH A FIXED RES.',\\n  '',\\n  '#PROMPT FEEDBACK',\\n  'MOST LIKED: THE PLAN\\\\'S EXACT NAMES, FILES, TESTS AND DONE CRITERIA.',\\n  'CONFUSING: THE TASK AND THE PLAN ASK FOR FAR MORE THAN ONE RUN FITS',\\n  '(SIX OPERATIONS, AI HUB, LOCAL CO-OP, RIGS, MODE 7), AND THE PLAN',\\n  'NAMES A DIFFERENT MODEL AND EFFORT FROM THE TASK. THE TASK WON.',\\n  'HARDEST: MULTIPLAYER INTEGRATION, WHICH NEEDS THE HUB HARNESS.',\\n  'WOULD CHANGE: SPLIT IT INTO MILESTONES, EACH WITH ITS OWN DONE LINE.',\\n];\\n})();\\n\",\"structuredPatch\":[{\"oldStart\":1,\"oldLines\":1,\"newStart\":1,\"newLines\":57,\"lines\":[\"-(() => { 'use strict'; globalThis.WP.CREDITS = globalThis.WP.ABOUT; })();\",\"+// The About and Credits screen's lines: the game's own credits, then the four sections the brief asks for (the same\",\"+// text is in the chat reply). Lines that start with # are headings. \\\"unknown\\\" marks what could not be confirmed.\",\"+(() => {\",\"+'use strict';\",\"+const WP = globalThis.WP;\",\"+\",\"+WP.CREDITS = [\",\"+  ...WP.ABOUT,\",\"+  '',\",\"+  '#SOURCE INFORMATION',\",\"+  'DATE: 2026-11-03 18:50:13',\",\"+  'SOURCE: OPERATION WOLF (TAITO, 1987)',\",\"+  'PLAN: PLAN.MD (WRITTEN FOR THE GAME, BUILT FROM IT)',\",\"+  'GENRE: FIRST-PERSON LIGHT-GUN RAIL SHOOTER (SHOOTER)',\",\"+  'PERSPECTIVE: FIRST PERSON ON A SCRIPTED RAIL, SIDEWAYS AND IN DEPTH',\",\"+  'TECH: MY-3D2DGE ENGINE 0.85.2 (HANDOFF), JAVASCRIPT, 480X270 PIXEL CANVAS',\",\"+  'ART DIRECTION: PIXEL ART MADE IN CODE, DEPTH-SCALED, DUSK AND DAWN PALETTES',\",\"+  'ANIMATION: PROCEDURAL (RISE AND DROP FROM COVER, CLOSING RI