verpool / Sony Computer Entertainment, 2008)',","+    plan: 'PLAN.md',","+    genre: 'Anti-gravity combat racing (arcade), with a survival mode (Overclock) and a combat-points mode (Snipeout)',","+    perspective: 'Third-person chase camera (near and far) with a cockpit view and a look-back camera; trackside TV cameras for intros, spectating, replays and the attract mode',","+    tech: 'my-3D2dge v0.85.2 handoff engine (with marked edits) + my-3D2dge 3D add-on v0.85.2 (World3D); three.js r182 (WebGPU, falling back to WebGL 2) and Rapier 0.19.3 from the jsDelivr CDN; AI Hub session client 1.4.0; plain JavaScript; Node and Playwright 1.63.0 for tests',","+    artDirection: 'The engine\\'s native style: pixel-resolution 3D with toon and lambert light, bloom, the engine\\'s pixel fonts and HUD; new procedural assets: six craft designs with team liveries, banked neon-walled tracks, tunnels, pads, gantries, sponsor boards, four themed worlds (Riviera coast, red-rock desert, night megacity, arctic basin) and a neon-grid Overclock skin',","+    animation: 'The engine\\'s rigs (pilot cards and live portraits, podium poses cheer, wave and hips) and tweens; new procedural craft animation (bank and yaw roll, barrel rolls, hinged airbrake flaps, engine glow, exhaust and boost trails, shield flashes, explosions, the rescue drone), animated pads, turbines, Ferris wheel, lighthouse beam, aurora, traffic, weather',","+    audio: 'All synthesized in code: six original electronic songs built from chord progressions and patterns for the engine tracker (extended with filter envelopes, unison, pan, accents, claps, sub booms and sidechain), layered by race events; about 60 synthesized sound effects; engine hums with Doppler and pan; Animalese/Simlish-style gibberish voices for the announcer, pilots and principals',","+    online: 'AI Hub ghost-mode sessions (1 to 4 players race the same seeded event and see each other as ghosts); local 2-player split-screen Versus for the game on its own',","+    testing: 'Headless Node suites driving game.advance and game.debug (unit, physics, race, weapons, modes, flow, season, audio, hub mock) including a scripted playthrough of the whole game, plus Playwright browser checks of the bundle and screenshots; one command, failures only and a one-line count',","+    research: 'None beyond the plan; the engine docs and the AI Hub README were read',","+    environment: 'Claude Code CLI (headless); Linux; browser unknown',","+    model: 'Anthropic, claude-opus-5-5, reasoning effort medium',","+    usage: 'unknown'","+  },","+  testingFeedback: [","+    'unknown',","+    'unknown',","+    'unknown',","+    'unknown'","+  ],","+  engineFeedback: [","+    'unknown', 'unknown', 'unknown', 'unknown', 'unknown', 'unknown'","+  ],","+  promptFeedback: [","+    'unknown', 'unknown', 'unknown', 'unknown'","+  ],","+  engineChanges: [","+    'Button symbols default to PlayStation and the option moved to Settings > Display (PlayStation or Xbox), so prompts follow the brief',","+    'PlayStation symbols added to both pixel fonts, so input.label() results print in running text',","+    'Analog button values: input.value(action) reads pad button values, so L2/R2 airbrakes are analog',","+    'Synth extensions: lowpass filter envelopes, unison detune, pan and accents on tracker notes, clap and sub-boom drums, kick sidechain ducking, for the electronic soundtrack',","+    'World3D particle ground can be the game\\'s own function, so sparks and debris land on the track deck, not the terrain below'","+  ],","+  aiHub: {","+    name: 'Snipeout HD', tagline: 'Anti-gravity. Anti-everyone.',","+    description: 'An anti-gravity combat racer: thread banked neon tracks at 600 km/h, snipe rivals with ten weapons and survive Overclock. Season, time trials, split screen and AI Hub ghost races.',","+    type: 'Game', genre: 'Racing', source: 'Wipeout HD', series: 'Wipeout', players: '1–4',","+    controls: 'Stick or A/D steer · ✕ or W thrust · L2/R2 or Q/E airbrakes · □ or Space fire · ○ or Shift absorb',","+    tags: ['3d', 'racing', 'sci-fi', 'vehicles', 'arcade', 'versus']","+  },","+  credits: [","+    'SNIPEOUT HD. An original game inspired by Wipeout HD. Not affiliated with Sony Interactive Entertainment.',","+    'Engine: my-3D2dge v0.85.2 and my-3D2dge 3D (MIT). three.js r182 (MIT). Rapier 0.19.3 (Apache-2.0). AI Hub session client 1.4.0.',","+    'All music, sound and voices synthesized in code. No image or sound files.',","+    'Built by Anthropic claude-opus-5-5 from PLAN.md.',","+    'The Hoverline Championship, its teams, pilots, principals, sponsors and recording artists are fictional.'","+  ]","+};","+})();"]}],"created":true},{"filePath":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build__20261103-183009__xe162c9/agent.out","hunks":[{"oldStart":1651,"oldLines":3,"newStart":1651,"newLines":5,"lines":[" {\"type\":\"system\",\"subtype\":\"thinking_tokens\",\"estimated_tokens\":1050,\"estimated_tokens_delta\":50,\"session_id\":\"a0704575-f16b-44ea-a24d-907e9c278025\",\"uuid\":\"02734ce8-d3a4-4055-8b02-4d36c57a47cd\"}"," {\"type\":\"assistant\",\"message\":{\"model\":\"claude-opus-5-5\",\"id\":\"msg_011Cgh6TuSUAAcizBB9PQjEh\",\"type\":\"message\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"thinking\",\"thinking\":\"\",\"signature\":\"\"}],\"container\":null,\"stop_reason\":null,\"stop_sequence\":null,\"stop_details\":null,\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":2,\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":7910,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":584237,\"cache_creation\":{\"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens\":0,\"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens\":7910},\"output_tokens\":7,\"service_tier\":\"standard\",\"inference_geo\":\"global\",\"speed\":\"standard\"},\"input_transformations\":[],\"diagnostics\":null,\"context_management\":null},\"parent_tool_use_id\":null,\"session_id\":\"a0704575-f16b-44ea-a24d-907e9c278025\",\"uuid\":\"1e05508e-4565-4987-a39d-bd1b3ddd0137\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-04T02:25:33.420Z\",\"request_id\":\"req_011Cgh6Tu9MS5X1qShhwjmBv\",\"thinking_duration_ms\":13326,\"thinking_display\":\"updates\"}"," {\"type\":\"assistant\",\"message\":{\"model\":\"claude-opus-5-5\",\"id\":\"msg_011Cgh6TuSUAAcizBB9PQjEh\",\"type\":\"message\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Now Op 2, Mangrove Run: a forward rail up a river with boat bob, a rippling water floor, side channels, a rope bridge you can drop, carriers in the trees, and CROCODILE at the end.\"}],\"container\":null,\"stop_reason\":null,\"stop_sequence\":null,\"stop_details\":null,\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":2,\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":7910,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":584237,\"cache_creation\":{\"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens\":0,\"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens\":7910},\"output_tokens\":7,\"service_tier\":\"standard\",\"inference_geo\":\"global\",\"speed\":\"standard\"},\"input_transformations\":[],\"diagnostics\":null,\"context_management\":null},\"parent_tool_use_id\":null,\"session_id\":\"a0704575-f16b-44ea-a24d-907e9c278025\",\"uuid\":\"26b9d604-0938-4e07-ba31-b5d442b819bb\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-04T02:25:33.424Z\",\"request_id\":\"req_011Cgh6Tu9MS5X1qShhwjmBv\"}","+{\"type\":\"assistant\",\"message\":{\"model\":\"claude-opus-5-5\",\"id\":\"msg_011Cgh6TuSUAAcizBB9PQjEh\",\"type\":\"message\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"id\":\"toolu_01Tfr2XyC6EdQUXtuomi7WC5\",\"name\":\"Write\",\"input\":{\"file_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build__20261103-183009__xe162c9/work/OperationWolfpack-OperationWolf-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261103-183009/src/42-op2.js\",\"content\":\"// OP 2: MANGROVE RUN (misty morning; a forward rail up a river). The river is 220 wide (|x| < 110); along = Y0 - y.\\n(() => {\\nconst E = My3D2dge, WP = globalThis.WP, L = WP.Layout, { px } = E;\\nL.seed(202);\\nconst W = (lx, along) => [lx, WP.Y0 - along];\\nconst S = WP.floorS, T = WP.FLOOR_TEX;\\nconst channel = (x, along) => (x > 100 && x < 520 && along > 660 && along < 760) || (x < -100 && x > -520 && along > 2060 && along < 2160);\\nconst water = (x, y) => { const a = WP.Y0 - y; return Math.abs(x) < 110 || channel(x, a) || (a > 3500 && Math.abs(x) < 400); };\\nconst RIVER = (x, y, D, t) => {\\n  const a = WP.Y0 - y, ax = Math.abs(x);\\n  if (water(x, y)) {\\n    const r = Math.sin(x * .08 + t * 1.6) + Math.sin(y * .05 + t * 2.2) + Math.sin((x + y) * .03 - t);\\n    const n = E.noise2(x / 26, (y + t * 30) / 26);\\n    let c = n > .55 ? 0xff3a5a4a : 0xff2e4e40; if (r > 2.2) c = 0xff7a9a8a; else if (r > 1.6) c = 0xff4a6a5a;\\n    if (ax > 96 && ax < 110 && !channel(x, a)) c = WP.lerpPk(c, 0xff22364a, .5);\\n    return c;\\n  }\\n  if (ax < 140) { let c = S(T.mud, x, y); if (((x * 3 + y * 7) | 0) % 23 === 0) c = 0xff1a2a3a; return c; }\\n  return E.noise2(x / 50, y / 50) > .5 ? S(T.leaves, x, y) : S(T.mud, x, y);\\n};\\nconst banks = [];\\nfor (const side of [-1, 1]) {\\n  for (let a = -100; a < 3600; a += 70) {\\n    const R = L.R;\\n    if (channel(side * 200, a)) continue;\\n    banks.push(L.one(R() < .55 ? 'mangrove' : 'palm', side * (150 + R() * 90), a + R() * 40, { size: .9 + R() * .5, facing: R() * 6.28 }));\\n    if (R() < .7) banks.push(L.one('fern', side * (125 + R() * 30), a + R() * 60, { size: .9 + R() * .6, facing: R() * 6.28 }));\\n    if (R() < .5) banks.push(L.one('mangrove', side * (300 + R() * 300), a + R() * 60, { size: 1.1 + R() * .5, facing: R() * 6.28 }));\\n  }\\n}\\nconst scenery = [\\n  banks,\\n  [L.one('stiltHut', 170, 620, { size: 1.1, facing: Math.PI / 2 + .9 }), L.one('stiltHut', -175, 1080, { size: 1.1, facing: Math.PI / 2 - .9 }), L.one('stiltHut', 185, 1110, { facing: Math.PI / 2 + .8 }),\\n    L.one('dock', 128, 770, { facing: Math.PI / 2 + Math.PI / 2 }), L.one('dock', -128, 1240, { facing: 0 }), L.one('wreckBoat', -80, 450), L.one('wreckBoat', 70, 1820, { facing: 2 }),\\n    L.one('dock', 40, 2200, { facing: 0, size: 1.2 }), L.one('dock', -60, 2600, { facing: 0 }), L.one('waterfall', 0, 3700, { size: 2.5 }), L.one('rock', -160, 3620, { size: 3 }), L.one('rock', 180, 3640, { size: 3.4 })]\\n];\\n// the rope bridge at along 1500, z 40: two ropes (props) and the planks between the banks\\nconst BR = 1500;\\nWP.defStage({\\n  id: 'op2', n: 2, name: 'MANGROVE RUN', music: 'op2', time: 'morning', forward: true, bob: true, water,\\n  toWorld: W,\\n  sky: { sky: ['#6a8a7a', '#9ab8a0', '#c8d8c0'], sun: { x: .3, y: .5, r: 16, color: '#f0f0d0' }, layers: [{ kind: 'forest', color: '#2e4a32', y: .72, height: .3, parallax: .06, seed: 4 }, { kind: 'forest', color: '#3e5e3e', y: .86, height: .18, parallax: .12, seed: 8 }, { kind: 'fog', color: '#c8d8c0', y: .82, height: .2 }] },\\n  fog: { color: '#a8c0a8', near: 200, far: 1100 }, grade: { mul: '#e8f8ec', add: '#000a04' },\\n  floor: RIVER, outside: '#2a3a2a', cam: { h: 20, pitch: 4, fov: 60 },\\n  rail: [{ d: 0, x: 0, y: WP.Y0, angle: -Math.PI / 2 }, { d: 2600, x: 0, y: WP.Y0 - 2600 }],\\n  speed: 20,\\n  holds: [{ d: 1000, until: 'air', max: 30, slow: 8 }, { d: 1300, until: 'flag', flag: 'bridgeDone', max: 14 }, { d: 2600, until: 'boss' }],\\n  scenery,\\n  props: [['rope', 'ropeL', -120, BR, { z: 34, world: true }], ['rope', 'ropeR', 120, BR, { z: 34, world: true }], ['barrel', 'fb1', 30, 2440, { z: 6 }], ['barrel', 'fb2', 44, 2446, { z: 6 }], ['crate', 'dk1', 120, 880, { z: 7, drop: 'gbox' }], ['crate', 'dk2', 134, 884, { z: 7 }]],\\n  init(sim) {\\n    sim.flags.bridge = 'up';\\n    for (const id of ['ropeL', 'ropeR']) { const r = sim.propById(id); if (r) r.onBreak = (s, e, p) => WP.Op2.bridgeOut(s, p); }\\n  },\\n  beats: [\\n    { at: 0, radio: 'op2.go' },\\n    { at: 60, spawn: [['rifleman', { beh: 'popup', lxs: [-130, 130, -150], dzs: [200, 230, 260], n: 3, gap: .5, cycles: 2 }]] },\\n    { at: 200, spawn: [['skiff', { lx: 20, dz: 420, passLx: -60 }]] },\\n    { at: 380, tip: 'tip.knife', spawn: [['knife', { beh: 'branch', lxs: [-60, 60], dz: 74, z: 40, n: 2, gap: .7 }]] },\\n    { at: 520, spawn: [['monkey', { lx: 150, dz: 160, z: 34, carry: 'gbox' }], ['rifleman', { lxs: [110, 130, 150], dz: 250, z: 8, n: 3, gap: .4, beh: 'stand', cycles: 2 }]] },\\n    { at: 700, spawn: [['skiff', { lx: 260, dz: 300, cross: true, dir: -1, n: 2, gap: 1.6 }]] },\\n    { at: 860, spawn: [['grenadier', { beh: 'roof', lxs: [-175, 185], dz: 230, z: 28, n: 2, gap: .6, cycles: 3 }]] },\\n    { at: 1000, hold: 1000, radio: 'air.in', run: (sim, b) => { const h = sim.spawn('heli', { lx: 60, dz: 800, z: 60, beh: 'heli', beat: b }); sim.after(5, () => { for (let i = 0; i < 3; i++) sim.spawn('para', { lx: (i - 1) * 140, dz: 220, z: 150, beat: b }); }); void h; } },\\n    { at: 1250, radio: 'op2.bridge', tip: 'tip.bridge', run: (sim, b) => { for (let i = 0; i < sim.count(5); i++) { const e = sim.spawn('rifleman', { x: -80 + i * 40, y: WP.Y0 - BR, z: 40, beh: 'stand', cycles: 3, beat: b }); if (e) { e.onBridge = true; e.floorZ = 40; } } sim.after(16, () => { sim.flags.bridgeDone = true; }); } },\\n    { at: 1500, spawn: [['gunboat', { lx: -20, dz: 350 }], ['mortar', { lx: 220, dz: 700 }], ['mortar', { lx: 240, dz: 700, loader: true }]] },\\n    { at: 1700, spawn: [['parrot', { side: 'L', dz: 140, z: 60, carry: 'fury' }], ['parrot', { side: 'L', dz: 160, z: 70 }], ['parrot', { side: 'R', dz: 150, z: 55, carry: 'mag' }], ['rifleman', { beh: 'popup', lxs: [-140, 140, -160, 160], dzs: [180, 200, 240, 260], n: 4, gap: .4 }]] },\\n    { at: 1900, spawn: [['skiff', { lx: -30, dz: 420, passLx: 60 }], ['brute', { lx: 40, dz: 300, z: 9, beh: 'stand', cycles: 3 }], ['rifleman', { lxs: [20, 60], dz: 300, z: 9, n: 2, gap: .4, beh: 'stand', cycles: 2 }]] },\\n    { at: 2100, spawn: [['rifleman', { lx: -260, dz: 120, n: 3, gap: .8, beh: 'cross', dir: 1, stops: 1 }], ['sniper', { lx: 170, dz: 500, z: 60, beh: 'snipe' }]] },\\n    { at: 2350, spawn: [['knife', { beh: 'branch', lxs: [-70, 70], dz: 72, z: 42, n: 2, gap: .5 }], ['skiff', { lx: 10, dz: 430, passLx: -55 }]] },\\n    { at: 2600 }\\n  ],\\n  quotas: { soldier: 28, boat: 6, air: 1 }, boss: 'crocodile', perk: 'campLocated', clearHeal: 10,\\n  reinforce: { soldier: ['rifleman', 'rifleman', 'knife'], boat: 'skiff' },\\n  ambient: [['parrot', 400, 900], ['monkey', 160, 1400, 'ration'], ['parrot', -200, 2300]],\\n  drawExtra(m7, world, R) {\\n    if (world.flags && world.flags.bridge === 'down') return;\\n    // the rope bridge: two ropes sagging between the banks, planks hung under them\\n    const y = WP.Y0 - BR, fall = world.flags && world.flags.bridgeFall || 0;\\n    m7.add(0, y, 0, (g, sx, sy, k) => {\\n      const V = world.view, a = V.project(-130, y, 46), b = V.project(130, y, 46); if (!a || !b) return;\\n      for (let i = 0; i <= 24; i++) { const u = i / 24, x = -130 + u * 260, sag = Math.sin(u * Math.PI) * 10, z = 40 - sag - fall * u * 40, p = V.project(x, y, z), q = V.project(x, y, z + 6); if (!p || !q) continue; px.rect(g, p[0] - 1.5 * k, p[1] - 1, 3 * k, Math.max(1, k), '#7a5a32'); px.line(g, p[0], q[1], p[0], p[1], '#4a3420'); }\\n      for (const dz of [6, 0]) { let prev = null; for (let i = 0; i <= 24; i++) { const u = i / 24, x = -130 + u * 260, z = 40 + dz - Math.sin(u * Math.PI) * 10 - fall * u * 40, p = V.project(x, y, z); if (p && prev) px.line(g, prev[0], prev[1], p[0], p[1], '#3a2a18', Math.max(1, Math.round(k * .6))); prev = p; } }\\n      for (const x of [-130, 130]) { const p = V.project(x, y, 0), q = V.project(x, y, 52); if (p && q) px.line(g, p[0], p[1], q[0], q[1], '#5a4020', Math.max(2, Math.round(k * 2))); }\\n    });\\n  }\\n});\\nWP.Op2 = {\\n  bridgeOut(sim, p) {\\n    if (sim.flags.bridge !== 'up') return;\\n    sim.flags.bridge = 'falling'; sim.flags.bridgeFall = 0; sim.radio('bridgeOut');\\n    sim.ev('bridgeOut', {});\\n    for (const e of sim.ents) if (e.onBridge && !e.dead) { sim.kill(e, p ? p.pid : null, 'body', 'fall'); if (p) sim.score(p, 300, { x: e.x, y: e.y, z: e.z }, { raw: true }); e.floorZ = 0; e.vz = 40; }\\n    const fall = () => { sim.flags.bridgeFall = Math.min(1, sim.flags.bridgeFall + .05); if (sim.flags.bridgeFall < 1) sim.after(.04, fall); else { sim.flags.bridge = 'down'; sim.flags.bridgeDone = true; } };\\n    fall();\\n    WP.FX && 0;\\n  }\\n};\\n})();\\n\"},\"caller\":{\"type\":\"direct\"}}],\"container\":null,\"stop_reason\":null,\"stop_sequence\":null,\"stop_details\":null,\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":2,\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":7910,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":584237,\"cache_creation\":{\"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens\":0,\"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens\":7910},\"output_tokens\":7,\"service_tier\":\"standard\",\"inference_geo\":\"global\",\"speed\":\"standard\"},\"input_transformations\":[],\"diagnostics\":null,\"context_management\":null},\"parent_tool_use_id\":null,\"session_id\":\"a0704575-f16b-44ea-a24d-907e9c278025\",\"uuid\":\"27d7c0f3-fbdf-40e7-8e0c-65144f4894eb\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-04T02:26:11.491Z\",\"request_id\":\"req_011Cgh6Tu9MS5X1qShhwjmBv\",\"wire_tool_inputs\":{\"toolu_01Tfr2XyC6EdQUXtuomi7WC5\":{\"file_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build__20261103-183009__xe162c9/work/OperationWolfpack-OperationWolf-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261103-183009/src/42-op2.js\",\"content\":\"// OP 2: MANGROVE RUN (misty morning; a forward rail up a river). The river is 220 wide (|x| < 110); along = Y0 - y.\\n(() => {\\nconst E = My3D2dge, WP = globalThis.WP, L = WP.Layout, { px } = E;\\nL.seed(202);\\nconst W = (lx, along) => [lx, WP.Y0 - along];\\nconst S = WP.floorS, T = WP.FLOOR_TEX;\\nconst channel = (x, along) => (x > 100 && x < 520 && along > 660 && along < 760) || (x < -100 && x > -520 && along > 2060 && along < 2160);\\nconst water = (x, y) => { const a = WP.Y0 - y; return Math.abs(x) < 110 || channel(x, a) || (a > 3500 && Math.abs(x) < 400); };\\nconst RIVER = (x, y, D, t) => {\\n  const a = WP.Y0 - y, ax = Math.abs(x);\\n  if (water(x, y)) {\\n    const r = Math.sin(x * .08 + t * 1.6) + Math.sin(y * .05 + t * 2.2) + Math.sin((x + y) * .03 - t);\\n    const n = E.noise2(x / 26, (y + t * 30) / 26);\\n    let c = n > .55 ? 0xff3a5a4a : 0xff2e4e40; if (r > 2.2) c = 0xff7a9a8a; else if (r > 1.6) c = 0xff4a6a5a;\\n    if (ax > 96 && ax < 110 && !channel(x, a)) c = WP.lerpPk(c, 0xff22364a, .5);\\n    return c;\\n  }\\n  if (ax < 140) { let c = S(T.mud, x, y); if (((x * 3 + y * 7) | 0) % 23 === 0) c = 0xff1a2a3a; return c; }\\n  return E.noise2(x / 50, y / 50) > .5 ? S(T.leaves, x, y) : S(T.mud, x, y);\\n};\\nconst banks = [];\\nfor (const side of [-1, 1]) {\\n  for (let a = -100; a < 3600; a += 70) {\\n    const R = L.R;\\n    if (channel(side * 200, a)) continue;\\n    banks.push(L.one(R() < .55 ? 'mangrove' : 'palm', side * (150 + R() * 90), a + R() * 40, { size: .9 + R() * .5, facing: R() * 6.28 }));\\n    if (R() < .7) banks.push(L.one('fern', side * (125 + R() * 30), a + R() * 60, { size: .9 + R() * .6, facing: R() * 6.28 }));\\n    if (R() < .5) banks.push(L.one('mangrove', side * (300 + R() * 300), a + R() * 60, { size: 1.1 + R() * .5, facing: R() * 6.28 }));\\n  }\\n}\\nconst scenery = [\\n  banks,\\n  [L.one('stiltHut', 170, 620, { size: 1.1, facing: Math.PI / 2 + .9 }), L.one('stiltHut', -175, 1080, { size: 1.1, facing: Math.PI / 2 - .9 }), L.one('stiltHut', 185, 1110, { facing: Math.PI / 2 + .8 }),\\n    L.one('dock', 128, 770, { facing: Math.PI / 2 + Math.PI / 2 }), L.one('dock', -128, 1240, { facing: 0 }), L.one('wreckBoat', -80, 450), L.one('wreckBoat', 70, 1820, { facing: 2 }),\\n    L.one('dock', 40, 2200, { facing: 0, size: 1.2 }), L.one('dock', -60, 2600, { facing: 0 }), L.one('waterfall', 0, 3700, { size: 2.5 }), L.one('rock', -160, 3620, { size: 3 }), L.one('rock', 180, 3640, { size: 3.4 })]\\n];\\n// the rope bridge at along 1500, z 40: two ropes (props) and the planks between the banks\\nconst BR = 1500;\\nWP.defStage({\\n  id: 'op2', n: 2, name: 'MANGROVE RUN', music: 'op2', time: 'morning', forward: true, bob: true, water,\\n  toWorld: W,\\n  sky: { sky: ['#6a8a7a', '#9ab8a0', '#c8d8c0'], sun: { x: .3, y: .5, r: 16, color: '#f0f0d0' }, layers: [{ kind: 'forest', color: '#2e4a32', y: .72, height: .3, parallax: .06, seed: 4 }, { kind: 'forest', color: '#3e5e3e', y: .86, height: .18, parallax: .12, seed: 8 }, { kind: 'fog', color: '#c8d8c0', y: .82, height: .2 }] },\\n  fog: { color: '#a8c0a8', near: 200, far: 1100 }, grade: { mul: '#e8f8ec', add: '#000a04' },\\n  floor: RIVER, outside: '#2a3a2a', cam: { h: 20, pitch: 4, fov: 60 },\\n  rail: [{ d: 0, x: 0, y: WP.Y0, angle: -Math.PI / 2 }, { d: 2600, x: 0, y: WP.Y0 - 2600 }],\\n  speed: 20,\\n  holds: [{ d: 1000, until: 'air', max: 30, slow: 8 }, { d: 1300, until: 'flag', flag: 'bridgeDone', max: 14 }, { d: 2600, until: 'boss' }],\\n  scenery,\\n  props: [['rope', 'ropeL', -120, BR, { z: 34, world: true }], ['rope', 'ropeR', 120, BR, { z: 34, world: true }], ['barrel', 'fb1', 30, 2440, { z: 6 }], ['barrel', 'fb2', 44, 2446, { z: 6 }], ['crate', 'dk1', 120, 880, { z: 7, drop: 'gbox' }], ['crate', 'dk2', 134, 884, { z: 7 }]],\\n  init(sim) {\\n    sim.flags.bridge = 'up';\\n    for (const id of ['ropeL', 'ropeR']) { const r = sim.propById(id); if (r) r.onBreak = (s, e, p) => WP.Op2.bridgeOut(s, p); }\\n  },\\n  beats: [\\n    { at: 0, radio: 'op2.go' },\\n    { at: 60, spawn: [['rifleman', { beh: 'popup', lxs: [-130, 130, -150], dzs: [200, 230, 260], n: 3, gap: .5, cycles: 2 }]] },\\n    { at: 200, spawn: [['skiff', { lx: 20, dz: 420, passLx: -60 }]] },\\n    { at: 380, tip: 'tip.knife', spawn: [['knife', { beh: 'branch', lxs: [-60, 60], dz: 74, z: 40, n: 2, gap: .7 }]] },\\n    { at: 520, spawn: [['monkey', { lx: 150, dz: 160, z: 34, carry: 'gbox' }], ['rifleman', { lxs: [110, 130, 150], dz: 250, z: 8, n: 3, gap: .4, beh: 'stand', cycles: 2 }]] },\\n    { at: 700, spawn: [['skiff', { lx: 260, dz: 300, cross: true, dir: -1, n: 2, gap: 1.6 }]] },\\n    { at: 860, spawn: [['grenadier', { beh: 'roof', lxs: [-175, 185], dz: 230, z: 28, n: 2, gap: .6, cycles: 3 }]] },\\n    { at: 1000, hold: 1000, radio: 'air.in', run: (sim, b) => { const h = sim.spawn('heli', { lx: 60, dz: 800, z: 60, beh: 'heli', beat: b }); sim.after(5, () => { for (let i = 0; i < 3; i++) sim.spawn('para', { lx: (i - 1) * 140, dz: 220, z: 150, beat: b }); }); void h; } },\\n    { at: 1250, radio: 'op2.bridge', tip: 'tip.bridge', run: (sim, b) => { for (let i = 0; i < sim.count(5); i++) { const e = sim.spawn('rifleman', { x: -80 + i * 40, y: WP.Y0 - BR, z: 40, beh: 'stand', cycles: 3, beat: b }); if (e) { e.onBridge = true; e.floorZ = 40; } } sim.after(16, () => { sim.flags.bridgeDone = true; }); } },\\n    { at: 1500, spawn: [['gunboat', { lx: -20, dz: 350 }], ['mortar', { lx: 220, dz: 700 }], ['mortar', { lx: 240, dz: 700, loader: true }]] },\\n    { at: 1700, spawn: [['parrot', { side: 'L', dz: 140, z: 60, carry: 'fury' }], ['parrot', { side: 'L', dz: 160, z: 70 }], ['parrot', { side: 'R', dz: 150, z: 55, carry: 'mag' }], ['rifleman', { beh: 'popup', lxs: [-140, 140, -160, 160], dzs: [180, 200, 240, 260], n: 4, gap: .4 }]] },\\n    { at: 1900, spawn: [['skiff', { lx: -30, dz: 420, passLx: 60 }], ['brute', { lx: 40, dz: 300, z: 9, beh: 'stand', cycles: 3 }], ['rifleman', { lxs: [20, 60], dz: 300, z: 9, n: 2, gap: .4, beh: 'stand', cycles: 2 }]] },\\n    { at: 2100, spawn: [['rifleman', { lx: -260, dz: 120, n: 3, gap: .8, beh: 'cross', dir: 1, stops: 1 }], ['sniper', { lx: 170, dz: 500, z: 60, beh: 'snipe' }]] },\\n    { at: 2350, spawn: [['knife', { beh: 'branch', lxs: [-70, 70], dz: 72, z: 42, n: 2, gap: .5 }], ['skiff', { lx: 10, dz: 430, passLx: -55 }]] },\\n    { at: 2600 }\\n  ],\\n  quotas: { soldier: 28, boat: 6, air: 1 }, boss: 'crocodile', perk: 'campLocated', clearHeal: 10,\\n  reinforce: { soldier: ['rifleman', 'rifleman', 'knife'], boat: 'skiff' },\\n  ambient: [['parrot', 400, 900], ['monkey', 160, 1400, 'ration'], ['parrot', -200, 2300]],\\n  drawExtra(m7, world, R) {\\n    if (world.flags && world.flags.bridge === 'down') return;\\n    // the rope bridge: two ropes sagging between the banks, planks hung under them\\n    const y = WP.Y0 - BR, fall = world.flags && world.flags.bridgeFall || 0;\\n    m7.add(0, y, 0, (g, sx, sy, k) => {\\n      const V = world.view, a = V.project(-130, y, 46), b = V.project(130, y, 46); if (!a || !b) return;\\n      for (let i = 0; i <= 24; i++) { const u = i / 24, x = -130 + u * 260, sag = Math.sin(u * Math.PI) * 10, z = 40 - sag - fall * u * 40, p = V.project(x, y, z), q = V.project(x, y, z + 6); if (!p || !q) continue; px.rect(g, p[0] - 1.5 * k, p[1] - 1, 3 * k, Math.max(1, k), '#7a5a32'); px.line(g, p[0], q[1], p[0], p[1], '#4a3420'); }\\n      for (const dz of [6, 0]) { let prev = null; for (let i = 0; i <= 24; i++) { const u = i / 24, x = -130 + u * 260, z = 40 + dz - Math.sin(u * Math.PI) * 10 - fall * u * 40, p = V.project(x, y, z); if (p && prev) px.line(g, prev[0], prev[1], p[0], p[1], '#3a2a18', Math.max(1, Math.round(k * .6))); prev = p; } }\\n      for (const x of [-130, 130]) { const p = V.project(x, y, 0), q = V.project(x, y, 52); if (p && q) px.line(g, p[0], p[1], q[0], q[1], '#5a4020', Math.max(2, Math.round(k * 2))); }\\n    });\\n  }\\n});\\nWP.Op2 = {\\n  bridgeOut(sim, p) {\\n    if (sim.flags.bridge !== 'up') return;\\n    sim.flags.bridge = 'falling'; sim.flags.bridgeFall = 0; sim.radio('bridgeOut');\\n    sim.ev('bridgeOut', {});\\n    for (const e of sim.ents) if (e.onBridge && !e.dead) { sim.kill(e, p ? p.pid : null, 'body', 'fall'); if (p) sim.score(p, 300, { x: e.x, y: e.y, z: e.z }, { raw: true }); e.floorZ = 0; e.vz = 40; }\\n    const fall = () => { sim.flags.bridgeFall = Math.min(1, sim.flags.bridgeFall + .05); if (sim.flags.bridgeFall < 1) sim.after(.04, fall); else { sim.flags.bridge = 'down'; sim.flags.bridgeDone = true; } };\\n    fall();\\n    WP.FX && 0;\\n  }\\n};\\n})();\\n\"}}}","+{\"type\":\"user\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"tool_use_id\":\"toolu_01Tfr2XyC6EdQUXtuomi7WC5\",\"type\":\"tool_result\",\"content\":\"File created successfully at: /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build__202